meta {
  name: Health Check
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/xrpc/_health
  body: none
  auth: none
}

vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:8080
}

docs {
  Liveness probe. 200 with `{"version": "custos v0.8.1", "db": "ok"}` when the database
  pool answers, 503 with `"db": "error"` when it does not.

  `version` is self-identifying (`custos vX.Y.Z`), not a bare version number: this is the
  endpoint third-party AT Protocol diagnostic tooling reads to fingerprint an
  implementation, and the same shape millipds reports.
}
